{"a":[109,109],"h":"<p>109.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"74\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 74.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.0 24.0 36.8 43.6 43.6 51.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"36.8 57.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> cinsi bahir, bütün cinsiyle deryalar<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"70\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 69.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.8 37.6 46.6 46.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.6 53.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p><p>- MİDAD, fil'asıl bir şeyin uzatılmasına medar olan şey'in ismidir. Fakat orfte yazı yazılan mürekkebe mahsus olmuştur.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"126\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 126.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.7 27.7 27.7 34.4 51.7 51.7 68.2 75.0 84.0 84.0 90.7 102.7 102.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.4 75.0 90.7 110.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> kelimatullah ki Allah tealânın ılm-ü hikmeti kelimeleri <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"182\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 182.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.7 39.7 55.6 55.6 62.3 62.3 69.0 69.0 75.7 75.7 84.7 84.7 100.6 107.3 114.0 114.0 120.7 120.7 141.7 141.7 150.0 157.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.7 39.7 107.3 150.0 157.6 165.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - çünkü kelimetullah, nâmütenahî, denizler mütenahîdir. Mütenahîye mütenahî zammının mecmuu da mütenahîdir. </p>"}